WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.373
They took the spars
down from the Grafton

00:00:03.373 --> 00:00:05.023
and set them in the ground.

00:00:05.023 --> 00:00:06.859
By winter they had a house.

00:00:11.271 --> 00:00:14.453
Two squares of cabin
glass let in the daylight.

00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:16.403
At the table Raynal carved chessmen

00:00:16.403 --> 00:00:19.323
from thin strips of wood,
red against white.

